title: Tommy
---
//Going to Tommy's House.
title: Tommy_Introduction
Tommy: Yoooo Big Cheese! What up my Fetta.
Renatto: Hey Tommy, I'm alright.
Tommy: Something wrong? You dont look so hot.
Renatto: I ran into some trouble thats all
Tommy: What kind of trouble, you using again? 
Tommy: I told you to lay off all the wizz that shit will kill you.
Renatto: I know I know. I just- I have to be around it. 
Renatto: You know I can't exactly tell the "De Meaux family" that I want to quit.
Renatto: Well...I guess that doesnt matter anymore.
Tommy: What do you mean Reño?
Tommy: Has something happened?
Renatto: I fucked up man... I fucked up real bad.
Tommy: What did you do?
Renatto: I fell into a rough patch and you know how they give me some product to sell?
Tommy: Yeah...
Tommy: You didnt...
Renatto: I just did a bit at first... and then I started using more and more.
Renatto: I thought they wouldnt notice.
Tommy: Okay.
Tommy: I know a guy who can get you out of here.
Renatto: No I can't do that.
Tommy: You're in danger Reño. You have to get out of here. You know what kind of stuff they do.
Renatto: I cant leave Francheesqua. I can't leave you.
Tommy: You have to worry about yourself man.. Francheesqua will be fine I'll make sure of it.
Tommy: And don't worry about me. I'll be okay. 
Tommy: I just.. I don't know what I'd do if something happened to you.
...
Renatto: I don't know man. I can't just up and leave I mean what if they hurt her. I have to protect her.
Tommy: How bad is it Reño.
Renatto: 50..50 thousand chedz.
Tommy: ...
Tommy: I know the landfill has been looking for some help, I can probably get you hooked up.
Tommy: I can chip in a bit too. How long do you have?
Renatto: Two weeks.
Tommy: Two weeks!!! That shit's impossible
Tommy: I'll see what I can scrounge up.
Renatto: No it's okay. I know you've been saving up. You guys should focus on moving out of here. I'll figure something out.
Tommy: Okay if you're sure.
Renatto: I'll see you later Tommy.
Tommy: You better...
Tommy: And be safe out there.
===
